    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">以一個動作，你可以揮舞這張卡片並瞄準距你120尺內的一個可見魔法物品。如果該物品不是神器，它的魔法屬性將被抑制1分鐘。這一特性一經使用，直到次日黎明之前無法再次使用。</span></p><p>As an action, you can brandish this card and target one magic item you can see within 120 feet of yourself. If the item isn't an artifact, its magical properties are suppressed for 1 minute. Once this property is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p></div>",
